\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Case study (Dry Funk): module activation profiles of retrieved prototypes. Under this benchmark, the retrieved prototype can contain module-level mismatches. Here, the Text-RAG prototype includes two spurious active modules (Screamer, Phaser), while the TRR prototype includes one (Screamer), illustrating that texture-aware retrieval yields a closer executable neighborhood in $\Theta $ for downstream correction.}}{8}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dryfunk_case}{{3}{8}{Case study (Dry Funk): module activation profiles of retrieved prototypes. Under this benchmark, the retrieved prototype can contain module-level mismatches. Here, the Text-RAG prototype includes two spurious active modules (Screamer, Phaser), while the TRR prototype includes one (Screamer), illustrating that texture-aware retrieval yields a closer executable neighborhood in $\Theta $ for downstream correction}{figure.caption.9}{}}
